NOTE ON DATA

This repository contains analysis code only. It does not contain the underlying
study data. NHANES is distributed by the US Centers for Disease Control and
Prevention; FinnGen by the University of Helsinki; GWAS Catalog entries by EMBL-EBI;
UK Biobank summary statistics via the MRC-IEU OpenGWAS interface; and 1000 Genomes
data by the International Genome Sample Resource. Each remains subject to its
provider's terms of use.
